{
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.BellyBigger": "<b>Your belly is getting bigger and bigger. Maybe your recent urges are to blame for this development?</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.Bulge": "<b>The unmistakable bulge of pregnancy is visible in your tummy, yet it feels odd inside you--wrong somehow.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.Bump": "<b>Sometimes you feel a bump in your pregnant belly. You wonder if it's your baby complaining about your moving about.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.Fluttering": "<b>You can feel the strangest fluttering sensations in your distended belly; it must be a pregnancy. You should eat more and drink plenty of wine so your baby can grow properly. Wait, wine...?</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.HornyAndHungry": "<b>With your bloating gut, you are loathe to exert yourself in any meaningful manner; you feel horny and hungry all the time...</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.KicksForFood": "<b>The baby you're carrying constantly kicks your belly in demand for food and wine, and you feel sluggish and horny. You can't wait to birth this little one so you can finally rest for a while.</b>[pg]"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.Painful": "<b>Your stomach is painfully distended by your pregnancy, making it difficult to walk normally.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.PotBelly": "<b>You've got the beginnings of a small pot-belly.</b>"
  "Pregnancy.Satyr.Sluggish": "<b>You find that you're feeling quite sluggish these days; you just don't have as much energy as you used to. You're also putting on weight.</b>[pg]"
}
